sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver
    participant Kiosk as Kiosk UI
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant STT as STT + NLU
    participant Gate as Gate Adapter
    participant Queue as Queue Engine
    participant SAP as SAP / SAB

    Note over Kiosk,SAP: Session already started with on-file phone from SAP

    Driver->>Kiosk: No — phone not correct
    Kiosk->>MW: session.input choice no
    MW->>Kiosk: session.update — AwaitingOwnerCheck

    Driver->>Kiosk: Yes — I am the owner
    Kiosk->>MW: session.input choice yes
    MW->>Kiosk: session.update — AwaitingPhoneSpeech

    Driver->>Kiosk: Hold to speak phone number
    Kiosk->>+STT: POST /stt audio
    STT->>STT: ElevenLabs transcribe + NLU digits
    STT-->>-Kiosk: text digits normalized

    Kiosk->>MW: session.input source stt phone_digits
    MW->>Kiosk: session.update — AwaitingPhoneConfirm read-back

    Driver->>Kiosk: Yes — digits correct
    Kiosk->>MW: session.input choice yes
    MW->>MW: visitPhone set — SAP phone unchanged

    MW->>Gate: openGate stub
    MW->>Queue: enqueue with visit phone only
